<P style="TEXT-ALIGN: left; LINE-HEIGHT: 28pt; TEXT-INDENT: 32pt; MARGIN: 0cm 0cm 0pt; mso-line-height-rule: exactly; mso-pagination: widow-orphan; mso-char-indent-count: 2.0" class=MsoNormal align=left><SPAN style="FONT-FAMILY: 仿宋_GB2312; FONT-SIZE: 16pt; mso-bidi-font-family: 'Times New Roman'; mso-hansi-font-family: 'Times New Roman'"><FONT face=Calibri>根据《绍兴一中<SPAN lang=EN-US>2018</SPAN>学年校级及以上各项先进推荐、评比方案》，经各支部、年级、学科民主推荐，校党政联席会议评议、审核，<SPAN lang=EN-US>2018</SPAN>学年度共有<SPAN lang=EN-US>93</SPAN>位老师被评为校级各类先进（名单附后）。其中“校级优秀党员”<SPAN lang=EN-US>19</SPAN>人，“校级优秀党务工作者”<SPAN lang=EN-US>7</SPAN>人，“校级优秀班主任”<SPAN lang=EN-US>18</SPAN>人，“校级先进工作者”<SPAN lang=EN-US>49</SPAN>人。现予以公布表彰（名单附后）。<SPAN lang=EN-US><o:p></o:p></SPAN></FONT></SPAN></P>
<P style="TEXT-ALIGN: left; LINE-HEIGHT: 28pt; TEXT-INDENT: 32pt; MARGIN: 0cm 0cm 0pt; mso-line-height-rule: exactly; mso-pagination: widow-orphan; mso-char-indent-count: 2.0" class=MsoNormal align=left><SPAN style="FONT-FAMILY: 仿宋_GB2312; FONT-SIZE: 16pt; mso-bidi-font-family: 'Times New Roman'; mso-hansi-font-family: 'Times New Roman'"><FONT face=Calibri>希望受表彰的教师再接再厉，努力进取，不断开创我校教育教学事业的新局面。</FONT></SPAN></P>
